 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "tRLVNJ059LAJ",
   "from": "Karl Broman",
   "author": "96353e7106735838",
   "date": "2014-09-15T13:16:52Z",
   "subject": "plotting multiple QTL confidence intervals on plot of genetic map or with LOD curves",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">I was wondering whether there was a way to plot multiple confidence intervals on 4 separate linkage groups found on one graph. To be specific, I have 4 chromosomes on one graph, each possessing a QTL, and I am trying to plot the CI for each one of them. I have used &quot;lines()&quot;, but it seems that the CI only shows up for one of the chromosomes and not the other 3.  If I try to add more lines, the latter overlays on top of the former lines. I hope this makes sense.</blockquote>\r\n<p><br></p><p>I would use <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">segments()</font>.</p><p>Are you trying to plot the CI on the genetic map, or on the plot of the LOD curves?</p><p>Here&#39;s an example of the former.<br></p><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>hyper </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> calc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">genoprob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> threshold</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">map</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shift</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    thischr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ci </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lodint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    lo </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    hi </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    numchr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">chrnames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    segments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> numchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             lwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;violetred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    segments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> numchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             lwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;violetred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    segments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> numchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             lwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;violetred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div>And here&#39;s an example of the latter:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    thischr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ci </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lodint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    lo </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    hi </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ci</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    segments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xaxisloc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>             xaxisloc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;violetred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>    segments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xaxisloc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>             xaxisloc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;violetred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">         <br><br>    segments</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">xaxisloc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>             xaxisloc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thischr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;violetred&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">karl</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
