     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">To plot selected chromosomes, use the <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">chr</font> argument to <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">plot.scanone</font>, and also to <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">xaxisloc.scanone</font><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">. Here&#39;s an example. It&#39;s the same as before except the bits with </font><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">sigchr</font><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">.</font><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>hyper </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> calc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">genoprob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> scanone</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hyper</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> summary</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> threshold</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sigchr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sigchr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    thischr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> above3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ci </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lodint</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">out</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#